WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.391
(percussion music and vocalizing)

00:00:02.391 --> 00:00:04.898
- [Narrator] On Eil Malk Island in Palau,

00:00:04.898 --> 00:00:07.398
there is a lake like no other.

00:00:10.899 --> 00:00:13.942
The saltwater lake was once
connected to the ocean;

00:00:13.942 --> 00:00:17.236
but as the island changed,
it was closed off.

00:00:17.236 --> 00:00:20.623
Now in isolation, it is filled
with a jellyfish species

00:00:20.623 --> 00:00:24.040
found nowhere else: the golden jellyfish.

00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:27.045
These cryptic creatures spend their days

00:00:27.045 --> 00:00:30.420
migrating across the lake,
from one side to the other,

00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.339
following the path of the sun,

00:00:32.339 --> 00:00:34.016
which feeds the fast-growing algae

00:00:34.016 --> 00:00:37.463
that this jellyfish species feeds on.

00:00:37.463 --> 00:00:39.814
And with no predators
to keep them in check,

00:00:39.814 --> 00:00:42.017
the jellyfish swarm and fill the lake

00:00:42.017 --> 00:00:43.684
like a cloudy dream.

00:00:45.179 --> 00:00:46.856
It's safe for humans to swim in,

00:00:46.856 --> 00:00:49.477
because though these
jellyfish do have stingers,

00:00:49.477 --> 00:00:52.810
they are too small to be felt by humans.

00:00:53.941 --> 00:00:55.449
Gliding through this place

00:00:55.449 --> 00:00:57.032
feels otherworldly.

00:01:02.655 --> 00:01:05.488
(electronic ping)

